    model_api_content_id: "5e73c5bcc2d34d06ab7a0fe491accab8"
  }
  code_action {
    action_spec {
      create_file {
        instruction: "# LIFE OS \342\200\224 Firestore Security Specification (Phase 0 TDD)\n\n## 1. Data Invariants\n1. **Strict Single-Tenant Ownership**: Every document lives under `/users/{userId}` or a direct subcollection `/users/{userId}/{subcollection}/{docId}`. No user may read, list, create, update, or delete another user\'s documents.\n2. **Verified Identity**: All authenticated read/write operations require `request.auth != null && request.auth.uid == userId && request.auth.token.email_verified == true`.\n3. **Integer Minor Units**: Financial amounts (`amountPiasters`, `paidAmountPiasters`, `limitPiasters`, `targetPiasters`, `currentPiasters`, `purchasePricePiasters`, `currentValuationPiasters`, `feesPiasters`) must be non-negative bounded numbers (`>= 0` and `<= 1000000000000`).\n4. **Immutable Ownership & Timestamps**: `userId` and `createdAt` cannot change after creation; `createdAt == request.time` on create and `updatedAt == request.time` on update.\n5. **Bounded Strings & Arrays**: Every string field has an explicit `.size()` upper bound matching `firebase-blueprint.json`; `milestones` array on `goals` is strictly bounded to `<= 20` items.\n6. **Zero Shadow Fields**: Create operations validate `hasAll` and `hasOnly`; update operations validate `affectedKeys().hasOnly(...)` combined with `isValid[Entity]()`.\n7. **Path ID Hardening**: All single-document operations validate `isValidId(docId)` (`^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\-]+$`, `<= 128` chars).\n\n## 2. The \"Dirty Dozen\" Attack Payloads (All Must Return PERMISSION_DENIED)\n1. **Cross-User Read**: User B attempts `get /users/userA/expense_records/exp1`.\n2. **Cross-User List**: User B attempts `list /users/userA/income_records`.\n3. **Unverified Email Write**: User A with `email_verified: false` attempts to create `/users/userA/expense_records/exp1`.\n4. **Identity Spoofing**: User A creates `/users/userA/expense_records/exp1` with `userId: \"userB\"`.\n5. **Shadow Field Injection**: User A adds `isAdmin: true` to `/users/userA` or `isVerified: true` to an expense record.\n6. **Negative Amount Poisoning**: User A submits `amountPiasters: -50000` on an expense record.\n7. **Resource Exhaustion / 1MB String**: User A submits a 50,000-character `description` string on a task.\n8. **ID Poisoning**: User A writes to `/users/userA/tasks/invalid$id!with*badchars`.\n9. **Immutable Field Tampering**: User A updates `createdAt` or `userId` on an existing expense record.\n10. **Forged Client Timestamp**: User A creates a document with a backdated `createdAt` instead of `serverTimestamp()` (`request.time`).\n11. **Unbounded Array Injection**: User A writes a `goals` document with 25 items in `milestones` (limit 20).\n12. **PII Leak Attempt**: Unauthenticated or non-owner user attempts to read `/users/userA` containing `email`.\n"
        path {
          absolute_uri: "file:///security_spec.md"
        }
        overwrite: true
      }
    }
    action_result {
      edit {
        diff {
          unified_diff {
            lines {
              text: "# LIFE OS \342\200\224 Firestore Security Specification (Phase 0 TDD)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 1. Data Invariants"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Strict Single-Tenant Ownership**: Every document lives under `/users/{userId}` or a direct subcollection `/users/{userId}/{subcollection}/{docId}`. No user may read, list, create, update, or delete another user\'s documents."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Verified Identity**: All authenticated read/write operations require `request.auth != null && request.auth.uid == userId && request.auth.token.email_verified == true`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Integer Minor Units**: Financial amounts (`amountPiasters`, `paidAmountPiasters`, `limitPiasters`, `targetPiasters`, `currentPiasters`, `purchasePricePiasters`, `currentValuationPiasters`, `feesPiasters`) must be non-negative bounded numbers (`>= 0` and `<= 1000000000000`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "4. **Immutable Ownership & Timestamps**: `userId` and `createdAt` cannot change after creation; `createdAt == request.time` on create and `updatedAt == request.time` on update."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "5. **Bounded Strings & Arrays**: Every string field has an explicit `.size()` upper bound matching `firebase-blueprint.json`; `milestones` array on `goals` is strictly bounded to `<= 20` items."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "6. **Zero Shadow Fields**: Create operations validate `hasAll` and `hasOnly`; update operations validate `affectedKeys().hasOnly(...)` combined with `isValid[Entity]()`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "7. **Path ID Hardening**: All single-document operations validate `isValidId(docId)` (`^[a-zA-Z0-9_\\-]+$`, `<= 128` chars)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
