  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Verification Process**\n\nI\'m starting the verification process outlined in Ultra Mode Section 5, leveraging my `computer-use` skill to execute commands and capture the desktop. I\'ve set up a trap to ensure Playwright closes on exit, a crucial step for preventing resource leaks and ensuring clean execution. This is the first step!\n\n\n**Expanding Verification Scope**\n\nI\'ve expanded the verification scope to include both desktop (1440x900) and mobile (390x844) screenshots, saving them with unique filenames. Crucially, I\'m now verifying interactive journeys, starting with the Arabic RTL Home Dashboard to check for console errors and layout. I\'ll proceed to the Finance section to confirm Available Cash calculations, expense additions, and unpaid invoice handling. Time section testing and language toggling are also on the agenda.\n\n\n"
