    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nBuild **LIFE OS** (\"Understand Your Life. Manage Your Future.\" / \"\330\247\331\201\331\207\331\205 \330\255\331\212\330\247\330\252\331\203. \330\243\330\257\330\261 \331\205\330\263\330\252\331\202\330\250\331\204\331\203.\") \342\200\224 a complete, dark-mode, minimal, data-driven Personal Life Management & Intelligence Platform (mobile-first responsive + full desktop layout), defaulting to **Arabic (Egyptian-friendly wording, full RTL)** with an **English (LTR)** toggle and **EGP** currency stored in integer minor units (piasters).\n\nCore requested modules & requirements:\n- **Initial User Profile**: Fixed salary + Freelance projects, 8h fixed work schedule (`09:00\342\200\22317:00`), ~5\342\200\2236h sleep, Morning peak concentration, Goal: Expense organization & saving, Android smartphone, Xiaomi Smart Band, EGP currency. All settings editable.\n- **Navigation**: 5 main destinations (`Home`, `Finance`, `Time`, `Health`, `LIFE AI`) + secondary sections (`Digital Wellbeing`, `Goals`, `Reports`, `Connected Accounts`, `Settings`).\n- **Modules**:\n  1. Home Dashboard (Financial, Productivity, Health, Energy summaries + live Gemini AI Daily Briefing).\n  2. Finance Intelligence (Overview & Charts, Expenses + Voice/Natural-Language Egyptian Arabic Gemini parser with mandatory confirmation, Income & Freelance strictly excluding unpaid invoices from available cash, Budgets with warning/exceeded thresholds, Savings Goals with suggested monthly contribution, Manual Investment Tracker distinguishing manual valuations from market prices, Net Worth = Total Assets - Total Liabilities).\n  3. Time Intelligence (Smart morning-peak tasks + outside-working-hours confirmation guard, Calendar with delete confirmation, Focus Mode Pomodoro with distraction counter & history, Time Analytics).\n  4. Health & Fitness (Sleep & Activity charts, manual daily logging with source/timestamp, active vs total calorie separation, honest Xiaomi Smart Band / Android Health Connect integration notice).\n  5. Digital Wellbeing (6 app categories, nighttime usage, interruptions, honest Android Usage Stats privacy disclosure).\n  6. Energy Intelligence (Transparent non-medical weighted estimation model, 30-day baseline tracker, self-report check-in, measured vs inferred separation).\n  7. LIFE AI Personal Assistant (Server-side Gemini API with configurable model routing between `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` and `gemini-4-hydrogen`, minimal scoped context, daily request/token quota tracking, confirmation cards before executing mutations).\n  8. Google Ecosystem & Connected Accounts (Live Firebase Google Sign-In, honest status & privacy disclosures for Calendar/Drive/Gmail/Health Connect/Usage Stats, plus untrusted financial email receipt parser with mandatory confirmation).\n  9. Personal Goals (6 categories, milestones checklist, Gemini AI milestone suggestions).\n  10. Reports & Insights (Daily, Weekly, Monthly reports with Print/PDF, CSV, and JSON Backup export/restore).\n- **Platform honesty constraint**: This AI Studio environment builds a full-stack React + TypeScript + Express + Firebase + Gemini web app (mobile-first for Android browsers). Native Android Health Connect, Xiaomi Smart Band / Mi Fitness auto-sync, Android Usage Stats, and Flutter APK are documented honestly as requiring native Android runtime, while full manual logging & local/cloud persistence work end-to-end.\n\n## 2. Progress\n### Completed Infrastructure, Backend, Database & Tests\n- **Firebase Provisioned & Rules Deployed**:\n  - Provisioned via `fax.ProvisionFirebase` (`firebase-applet-config.json` exists with `projectId: \"gen-lang-client-0263267818\"`, `firestoreDatabaseId: \"ai-studio-4e76f6c4-b539-4410-a0da-2f24f693cedc\"`).\n  - Created `/firebase-blueprint.json`, `/security_spec.md`, `/eslint.config.mjs`, and hardened Eight-Pillars `/firestore.rules` (strict owner isolation under `/users/{userId}/...`, `email_verified == true`, `isValidId()`, strict `isValid[Entity]()` on create & update, `affectedKeys().hasOnly(...)`, `request.time` timestamp integrity, zero shadow fields).\n  - Audited `/firestore.rules` with `npx eslint firestore.rules` (exit code 0, zero errors) and deployed live via `rpc_action(service_name: \"fax\", method_name: \"DeployRules\")` (succeeded).\n- **Packages Installed & Config Updated**:\n  - Installed `firebase`, `recharts`, `@google/genai@latest`, `eslint`, `@firebase/eslint-plugin-security-rules`.\n  - Updated `/package.json` (`\"dev\": \"tsx server.ts\"`, `\"start\": \"node server.ts\"`), `/metadata.json` (`name: \"LIFE OS\"`, `requestFramePermissions: [\"microphone\"]`, `MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API`), `/index.html` (Arabic RTL default, Cairo + Plus Jakarta Sans + JetBrains Mono fonts, synced metadata), and `/src/index.css`.\n- **Full-Stack Server & Core Modules Created**:\n  - `/server.ts`: Express server on port `3000` mounting Vite middleware in dev and `dist/` in prod, with `@google/genai` (`User-Agent: \'aistudio-build\'`), rate limiting, daily briefing caching, and routes: `GET /api/health`, `POST /api/ai/parse-expense`, `POST /api/ai/briefing`, `POST /api/ai/chat`, `POST /api/ai/goal-milestones`.\n  - `/src/lib/firebase.ts`: Firebase initialization with `getFirestore(app, firebaseConfig.firestoreDatabaseId)`, `testFirestoreConnection()`, `OperationType`, `FirestoreErrorInfo`, and `handleFirestoreError`.\n  - `/src/types/lifeos.ts`, `/src/i18n/translations.ts`, `/src/data/seedData.ts`, `/src/context/LifeOsContext.tsx`, `/src/components/ErrorBoundary.tsx`.\n  - Pure logic + unit tests: `/src/utils/finance.ts`, `/src/utils/finance.test.ts`, `/src/utils/energy.ts`, `/src/utils/energy.test.ts`. Ran `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/finance.test.ts src/utils/energy.test.ts` -> **9/9 tests passed**.\n- **All UI Modules Created**:\n  - `/src/App.tsx`, `/src/components/ConfirmDialog.tsx`, `/src/components/VoiceExpenseModal.tsx`, `/src/components/HomeDashboard.tsx`, `/src/components/FinanceModule.tsx`, `/src/components/TimeModule.tsx`, `/src/components/HealthEnergyModule.tsx`, `/src/components/WellbeingModule.tsx`, `/src/components/LifeAiModule.tsx`, `/src/components/GoalsModule.tsx`, `/src/components/ReportsModule.tsx`, `/src/components/ConnectionsSettingsModule.tsx`.\n- **Skills Read in Full**:\n  - `ultra-mode`, `frontend-design` (+ `3_saas_dashboard.md`, `10_mobile_touch_apps.md`), `gemini-api`, `firebase-integration-rpc` (+ `firestore-rules-and-blueprint.md`, `error-handling-and-sdk.md`), `workspace-integration`, `computer-use`.\n\n### Verification Round 1 & Fixes Already Applied (Awaiting Round 2 Verification)\n- Ran `compile_applet` (succeeded) and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit` succeeded), then `restart_dev_server` (succeeded).\n- Ran **Playwright Round 1** (`r1-desktop.png`, `r1-mobile.png`, `r1-finance.png`, `r1-en-ltr.png`, zero console errors, interactive journeys for Finance add-expense, unpaid freelance exclusion, Time Pomodoro timer ticking `24:59`, and Arabic RTL -> English LTR toggle).\n- **Round 1 Critique Defects Identified & ALREADY EDITED** (not yet compiled/restarted/re-verified):\n  1. Recharts `PieChart` in `FinanceModule.tsx` rendered mid-animation as a small wedge -> fixed by setting `isAnimationActive={false}` on Recharts `Pie`, `Bar`, and `Area` components in `FinanceModule.tsx`, `TimeModule.tsx`, `HealthEnergyModule.tsx`, and `WellbeingModule.tsx`.\n  2. Arabic text inside `.font-mono-nums` (`JetBrains Mono`) disconnected Arabic letters (`\330\254 . \331\205`, `\330\243 \330\263 \330\247 \330\263`) -> fixed `--font-mono` fallback in `/src/index.css` to `\"JetBrains Mono\", \"Cairo\", \"Plus Jakarta Sans\", sans-serif` and switched Arabic prose labels in `HomeDashboard.tsx` and `FinanceModule.tsx` to `tabular-nums`.\n  3. Mobile 3-column financial KPI values wrapped `\330\254.\331\205` to a second line at `390px` -> fixed with `text-sm sm:text-lg whitespace-nowrap` in `HomeDashboard.tsx`.\n  4. Default Focus Mode label in `TimeModule.tsx` stayed Arabic after switching to English -> fixed via `useEffect` syncing unmodified default label on `isAr` change.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` and `gemini-4-hydrogen` do NOT require a paid API key (`show_aistudio_ui` `paid_model_flow` is NOT needed). Never pass deprecated sampling params (`temperature`, `topP`, `topK`) to `gemini-4-hydrogen`.\n- `getFirestore(app, firebaseConfig.firestoreDatabaseId)` is mandatory for connecting to the named Firestore database `ai-studio-4e76f6c4-b539-4410-a0da-2f24f693cedc`.\n- Because `playwright-cli` captures screenshots quickly, setting `isAnimationActive={false}` on Recharts avoids capturing mid-tween collapsed pie/bar charts.\n- Local sample mode (`localStorage` key `life_os_workspace_v1`) ensures every form, chart, and reload works immediately even before Google Sign-In, while Google Sign-In seamlessly switches to live Firestore `onSnapshot` persistence.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Transient RPC timeout during `ProvisionFirebase`**: Initial `ProvisionFirebase` returned `GraphQL errors: Internal error encountered`, followed by temporary container filesystem timeouts (`Timed out waiting for applet file system condition to be met`). The container recovered automatically and Firebase had finished provisioning (`firebase-applet-config.json` present, Firestore DB `ai-studio-4e76f6c4-b539-4410-a0da-2f24f693cedc` active). No retry needed.\n- **Round 1 Visual Bugs (all edited, pending Round 2 verification)**:\n  - Collapsed Recharts `PieChart` -> fixed with `isAnimationActive={false}`.\n  - Disconnected Arabic glyphs in `font-mono-nums` -> fixed `--font-mono` fallback stack to include `\"Cairo\"` + switched Arabic metadata labels to `tabular-nums`.\n  - Mobile KPI line-wrap (`28,000` / `\330\254.\331\205`) -> fixed with `text-sm sm:text-lg whitespace-nowrap`.\n  - Stale Arabic Focus Mode default label when switching to English -> fixed with `useEffect` in `TimeModule.tsx`.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- All Round 1 fix edits are saved on disk, **NOT YET compiled, restarted, or verified in Round 2**.\n- No background tasks or Playwright browsers are currently running (Round 1 closed Chromium cleanly via `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`).\n- Existing `.playwright-cli/` screenshots from Round 1: `r1-desktop.png`, `r1-mobile.png`, `r1-finance.png`, `r1-en-ltr.png`. Use **unique** filenames for Round 2 (`r2-desktop.png`, `r2-mobile.png`, `r2-finance.png`, `r2-en-ltr.png`).\n\n## 6. Next Steps (In Exact Priority Order)\n1. **Run Unit Tests + Build + Lint after Round 1 edits**:\n   - Run `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/finance.test.ts src/utils/energy.test.ts` (verify 9/9 still pass).\n   - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in parallel (must pass cleanly after the last edit).\n2. **Restart Dev Server**:\n   - Call `restart_dev_server` (HMR is disabled, so restart is required before Round 2 browser verification).\n3. **Run Verification Round 2 (Final Browser Verification \342\200\224 max 2 rounds total per Ultra Mode)**:\n   - Use `playwright-cli` with `trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`:\n     - Verify `r2-desktop.png` (`1440x900`) and `r2-mobile.png` (`390x844`): confirm Arabic text (`\330\254.\331\205`, `\331\210\330\266\330\271 \330\252\330\254\330\261\331\212\330\250\331\212 \331\205\330\255\331\204\331\212`, `\331\212\331\210\331\205 \330\243\330\263\330\247\330\263`) renders with crisp connected `Cairo` glyphs and single-line mobile KPIs.\n     - Navigate to Finance -> capture `r2-finance.png` and confirm the Spending by Category donut `PieChart` renders completely (full donut ring, not a collapsed sliver) and verify the Finance assertions in JS (`cashBefore === \'13,580 \330\254.\331\205\'`, `cashAfterExpense === \'13,330 \330\254.\331\205\'`, `cashAfterUnpaid === \'13,330 \330\254.\331\205\'`, `pendingAfterUnpaid === \'24,500 \330\254.\331\205\'`).\n     - Navigate to Time -> Focus Mode -> switch language to English (`LTR`) -> verify `document.documentElement.dir === \'ltr\'` AND focus label updates to `\"Morning Deep Work\"`, and verify `/api/health` returns `ok: true` with zero console errors.\n     - Inspect all Round 2 screenshots carefully.\n4. **If Round 2 passes with zero high-severity defects**:\n   - Provide a concise, honest final summary covering:\n     - Implemented modules & real integrations (Firebase Auth + deployed Firestore security rules, Express + server-side Gemini API endpoints, Voice/Natural-Language Egyptian Arabic expense parser, Arabic RTL / English LTR, EGP minor-unit math).\n     - What was verified (9/9 unit tests, desktop `1440x900` & mobile `390x844` screenshots, interactive Finance/Time/RTL-LTR journeys) and what was fixed between Round 1 and Round 2.\n     - Honest disclosure of native Android-only integrations (Android Health Connect, Xiaomi Smart Band / Mi Fitness, Android Usage Stats, Google Calendar/Drive/Gmail OAuth) and humble encouragement to review/harden `firestore.rules` before broad sharing (required by `firebase-integration-rpc` skill).\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Ultra Mode Rules**: Final build (`compile_applet` + `lint_applet`), unit tests (`npx --yes tsx --test`), and Round 2 browser captures must all run **after the last code edit**. Never exceed 2 browser verification rounds for an initial build. Always close Chromium (`trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT`).\n- **Firebase Skill Rule**: Be humble when describing `firestore.rules` and explicitly encourage the user to review and harden the rules before sharing the app broadly.\n- **No Fabricated Data / No Unverified Claims**: Only report what was genuinely tested and observed. Never claim native Android Health Connect / Mi Fitness / Gmail OAuth auto-sync is active on the web runtime.\n- **Communication Style**: Concise, scannable completion summary; no internal tool/step IDs; no hype.\n</summary>"
