  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Google Maps**\n\nI\'m starting by leveraging the Google Maps Platform, as requested. The primary focus is integrating the google-maps-platform skill.\n\n\n**Adding Voice Conversations**\n\nI\'m now integrating live voice conversations using the `gemini-3.8-live` model. I\'m focusing on real-time responses and user interaction within the app.\n\n\\n\\n\n\nI\'m working on integrating a multi-turn chat interface using Gemini. I will use a scrollable display and maintain conversation history. I\'ll need to incorporate system instructions. I plan to use the `gemini-4-carbon`, `gemini-4-neon`, `gemini-4-hydrogen`, and `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` models as specified for different tasks. I\'m prioritizing accuracy and efficiency.\n\n\n"
