  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Skill Requirements**\n\nI\'ve carefully reviewed the skill requirements. There are two interactive flows, specifically: a Google Maps Platform Skill that needs to make a call, and an Aistudio UI Skill that needs to render an interface. I\'m focusing on the mandatory first workflow for the Google Maps Platform, specifically the call and its integration.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Workflow Logic**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the Google Maps setup workflow. The initial `rpc_action` call is clear, followed by a conditional `show_aistudio_ui` call based on `eligibility_status`. I will now focus on that setup flow. I\'ll need to remember to \"STOP AND YIELD TURN\" after this step. This will need to happen before I can address the Gemini API.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "WvoDa9veNNu8kdUPwemC4Aw"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2684282940509956242"
